00:26:50.140 --> 00:26:52.140
Oliver wasn't even the real target.

00:26:52.140 --> 00:26:54.140
Then who was?

00:26:54.140 --> 00:26:55.140
I don't know.

00:26:55.140 --> 00:26:57.140
It's something they called watch.

00:26:57.140 --> 00:27:23.000
Tower.

00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:25.000
What the hell do you want?

00:27:25.000 --> 00:27:26.000
Round two?

00:27:26.000 --> 00:27:28.000
Oliver Clark's in trouble.

00:27:28.000 --> 00:27:33.049
You know, Tess, if he wanted to rematch all you to do is ask.

00:27:33.049 --> 00:27:34.049
I'm serious.

00:27:34.049 --> 00:27:39.609
He made me tell him where checkmates' headquarters are.

00:27:39.609 --> 00:27:57.720
After he found out, they captured something called Watchtower me.

00:27:57.720 --> 00:28:03.720
No alarms have been reported yet.

00:28:03.720 --> 00:28:17.369
There's no sign of Jones.

00:28:17.369 --> 00:28:18.369
That's because I'm still here.

00:28:18.369 --> 00:28:49.420
I must say I like your colors better when they were more patriotic.

00:28:49.420 --> 00:28:51.420
Kidnapping is illegal.

00:28:51.420 --> 00:28:52.420
Even for the government.

00:28:52.420 --> 00:28:56.420
I don't have time for polite requests.

00:28:56.420 --> 00:29:00.420
I have reason to believe there are aliens among us.

00:29:00.420 --> 00:29:04.420
They have designs much bigger than just getting green cards.

00:29:04.420 --> 00:29:08.529
I need your help.

00:29:08.529 --> 00:29:12.000
To do what?

00:29:12.000 --> 00:29:15.000
Chase down rumors and UFO stores?

00:29:15.000 --> 00:29:17.000
What if I have proof?

00:29:17.000 --> 00:29:19.000
Actual alien blood.

00:29:19.000 --> 00:29:22.000
The keystone to World War III.

00:29:22.000 --> 00:29:25.000
Maybe these aliens aren't here to start a war.

00:29:25.000 --> 00:29:26.000
If you don't here.

00:29:26.000 --> 00:29:30.000
If you don't stand with us, you stand against us.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:32.000
It's time for you to pick a side.

00:29:32.000 --> 00:29:35.000
Maybe this will help your indecisiveness.

00:29:35.000 --> 00:29:44.690
Stand ready for immediate orders.

00:29:44.690 --> 00:29:45.690
Let her go.

00:29:45.690 --> 00:29:48.690
I'm not being unreasonable.

00:29:48.690 --> 00:29:51.690
If you step forward out of the shadows,

00:29:51.690 --> 00:29:53.690
I will let Watch Tower go.

00:29:53.690 --> 00:30:03.180
Release her now.

00:30:03.180 --> 00:30:05.180
You sure are nice to look at.

00:30:05.180 --> 00:30:09.180
But I like to have my cake and eat it too.

00:30:09.180 --> 00:30:15.059
I want your loyalty to check me.

00:30:15.059 --> 00:30:19.059
Not anything happens to me and bye-bye Blondie.

00:30:19.059 --> 00:30:22.380
I know you're fast.

00:30:22.380 --> 00:30:25.380
But you can't stop a bullet when you don't know where she is.

00:30:25.380 --> 00:30:28.380
That would be murder.

00:30:28.380 --> 00:30:31.380
It's not murder at strategy.

00:30:31.380 --> 00:30:35.380
Something you could have used more of before coming here.

00:30:35.380 --> 00:30:39.390
What more do you want?

00:30:39.390 --> 00:30:42.390
The location of Watchtower's central database.

00:30:42.390 --> 00:30:46.140
You're after everyone who's ever worked at you.

00:30:46.140 --> 00:30:48.140
After everyone who's ever worked at Watchtower.

00:30:48.140 --> 00:30:50.140
Names, faces, addresses.

00:30:50.140 --> 00:30:52.140
The Black Canary and Pulse Aquaman.

00:30:52.140 --> 00:30:54.140
Cyborg.

00:30:54.140 --> 00:30:58.140
I need people with the abilities to end the war quickly and decisively.

00:30:58.140 --> 00:31:16.269
It's your move.

00:31:16.269 --> 00:31:18.269
Even if I gave you Watchtower's database,

00:31:18.269 --> 00:31:20.269
you know I'll come after you.

00:31:20.269 --> 00:31:22.269
The blur.

00:31:22.269 --> 00:31:24.269
He patrols the streets of Metropolis,

00:31:24.269 --> 00:31:26.269
protecting every citizen he can,

00:31:26.269 --> 00:31:30.269
but he lets the most valuable ally

00:31:30.269 --> 00:31:31.269
been for herself.

00:31:31.269 --> 00:31:32.269
I did not.

00:31:32.269 --> 00:31:33.269
abandoned her.

00:31:33.269 --> 00:31:34.269
Didn't you?

00:31:34.269 --> 00:31:37.269
You left your greatest asset vulnerable.

00:31:37.269 --> 00:31:45.150
All you have to do to save the life is give one simple address.

00:31:45.150 --> 00:31:54.900
Come in, White Queen.

00:31:54.900 --> 00:31:59.900
Come in, White Queen.

00:31:59.900 --> 00:32:01.900
I'm showing external power breach.

00:32:01.900 --> 00:33:06.599
When I clear the shoe, over.

00:33:06.599 --> 00:33:07.599
Did you, uh...

00:33:07.599 --> 00:33:09.599
No, I didn't tell her anything.

00:33:09.599 --> 00:33:11.599
All least we have that.

00:33:11.599 --> 00:33:14.599
I'm sorry, Chloe.

00:33:14.599 --> 00:33:16.599
I'm sorry for everything.

00:33:16.599 --> 00:33:17.599
I think we're both.

00:33:17.599 --> 00:33:19.599
day late and a dollar short in that department.

00:33:19.599 --> 00:33:24.130
But I abandoned you.

00:33:24.130 --> 00:33:26.130
I keep seeing you on the sidelines,

00:33:26.130 --> 00:33:30.410
but the truth is with Watchtower, you're right in the middle of the game.

00:33:30.410 --> 00:33:32.410
You didn't abandon me, Clark.

00:33:32.410 --> 00:33:34.410
You pushed me out of the way.

00:33:34.410 --> 00:33:36.410
Maybe I thought you'd be safer there.

00:33:36.410 --> 00:33:39.819
Maybe he just didn't trust me.

00:33:39.819 --> 00:33:41.819
I've broken your confidence in me, Clark.

00:33:41.819 --> 00:33:44.819
You saw Watchtower's big brother, and you turned away.

00:33:44.819 --> 00:33:47.819
And the less you confided in me, the less you have to depend on me.

00:33:47.819 --> 00:33:49.819
Smart.

00:33:49.819 --> 00:33:53.859
Probably.

00:33:53.859 --> 00:33:54.859
I didn't give you enough credit.

00:33:54.859 --> 00:34:06.640
You're the one who brought us together. You're the one who saw our potential.

00:34:06.640 --> 00:34:08.639
That potential's going to be short-lived.

00:34:08.639 --> 00:34:11.639
Waller saw our faces, and she's not going to stop coming after us.

00:34:11.639 --> 00:34:30.130
Tell me you caught them.

00:34:30.130 --> 00:34:33.130
I can't wait to see the defeat on their faces.

00:34:33.130 --> 00:35:12.420
I figured it's a public place. There's only so many weapons you can throw at me.

00:35:12.420 --> 00:35:17.940
I'm sorry.

00:35:17.940 --> 00:35:20.940
For everything I've done that's destroyed your trust.

00:35:20.940 --> 00:35:27.139
I think there's enough stationary for that test.

00:35:27.139 --> 00:35:33.400
I told you how to shut down the castle's power grid.

00:35:33.400 --> 00:35:36.030
It's worth something.

00:35:36.030 --> 00:35:37.030
Isn't it?

00:35:37.030 --> 00:35:40.909
What am I supposed to do here?

00:35:40.909 --> 00:35:45.909
You want me to do a handstands because you helped solve a problem that you created?

00:35:45.909 --> 00:35:50.909
Never would have gone after you if I'd known that you were the green arrow.

00:35:50.909 --> 00:35:51.909
This was back on me.

00:35:51.909 --> 00:35:57.500
This might be the last time that I ever see you.

00:35:57.500 --> 00:36:02.420
When I joined Checkmate, I took an oath.

00:36:02.420 --> 00:36:06.789
And I want to break.

00:36:06.789 --> 00:36:09.789
But there's only one way to leave Checkmate.

00:36:09.789 --> 00:36:29.639
What are you going to do?

00:36:29.639 --> 00:36:35.989
I'm going to go AWOL.

00:36:35.989 --> 00:36:43.940
I'm going to go underground.

00:36:43.940 --> 00:36:44.940
You know, I got it.

00:36:44.940 --> 00:36:48.940
you question though, did it hurt to do something moral for one's test?

00:36:48.940 --> 00:36:49.940
Did it hurt you?

00:36:49.940 --> 00:36:57.969
I'm taking a chance just being out here with you in the open.

00:36:57.969 --> 00:36:59.969
Yeah, okay. I understand that. Okay, we've gotten that far.

00:36:59.969 --> 00:37:01.969
What is it that you want? You're asking me for something.

00:37:01.969 --> 00:37:02.969
What is it you want?

00:37:02.969 --> 00:37:30.260
I need your help.

00:37:30.260 --> 00:37:32.260
There are times when I wish I could go back.

00:37:32.260 --> 00:37:35.260
Santorini sun says,

00:37:35.260 --> 00:37:41.260
and your freckles and your big dreams of changing the world

00:37:41.260 --> 00:37:48.150
back when I could trust you.

00:37:48.150 --> 00:37:49.150
And you betrayed me.

00:37:49.150 --> 00:38:14.769
Because if you ever come near me or my friends ever again,

00:38:14.769 --> 00:38:19.750
I will expose you to the world, you understand.

00:38:19.750 --> 00:38:40.659
Hi.

00:38:40.659 --> 00:38:41.659
Hey.

00:38:41.659 --> 00:38:42.659
Hey.

00:38:42.659 --> 00:38:44.659
Thanks for keeping my seat warm at watch though.

00:38:44.659 --> 00:38:46.659
Well, you're welcome. Don't get used to it.

00:38:46.659 --> 00:38:48.659
Oh, but your timing is so good.

00:38:48.659 --> 00:38:51.659
I mean, if you hadn't flipped that castle's electric switch when you did,

00:38:51.659 --> 00:38:52.659
I would...

00:38:52.659 --> 00:38:53.659
Probably.

00:38:53.659 --> 00:38:57.659
But, you know, I kind of like being out in the field, knowing I had a warm bed to come home to...

00:38:57.659 --> 00:39:02.599
That's very, very funny.

00:39:02.599 --> 00:39:03.599
It scared the light on me.

00:39:03.599 --> 00:39:08.510
You better be careful, Ali.

00:39:08.510 --> 00:39:11.510
I'm gonna start to think you're falling for me.

00:39:11.510 --> 00:39:32.739
Your identity's safe. For now.

00:39:32.739 --> 00:39:37.460
She's not wrong, you know.

00:39:37.460 --> 00:39:40.460
Waller. How so?

00:39:40.460 --> 00:39:46.059
When I saw the future Zad and his people had already started World War III,

00:39:46.059 --> 00:39:49.980
and we weren't winning.

00:39:49.980 --> 00:39:51.980
She was right about being prepared.

00:39:51.980 --> 00:39:57.809
Because as much as I want to believe that I've stopped that day from happening, it still might.

00:39:57.809 --> 00:40:01.150
You don't have to join her.

00:40:01.150 --> 00:40:08.469
But like she said, eventually, I have to choose sides.

00:40:08.469 --> 00:40:12.900
You can't.

00:40:12.900 --> 00:40:14.900
You are here for something far greater, Clark.

00:40:14.900 --> 00:40:20.900
You will be the ambassador who bridges all the sides together.

00:40:20.900 --> 00:40:28.889
What were you doing, John? Why not include the rest of us?

00:40:28.889 --> 00:40:36.369
I would have told the team what was going on.

00:40:36.369 --> 00:40:41.369
But I wanted you and the rest of them to stay off checkmates' radar.

00:40:41.369 --> 00:40:44.650
But you're not in this alone.

00:40:44.650 --> 00:40:48.090
Who you're working for?

00:40:48.090 --> 00:40:53.449
Let's just say that...

00:40:53.449 --> 00:40:57.210
There are more players on the board than you think.

00:40:57.210 --> 00:41:00.619
And when it comes to choosing sides,

00:41:00.619 --> 00:41:11.780
Besides, things aren't always black and white.

00:41:11.780 --> 00:41:14.780
I want the report of Agent Mercer's last physical.

00:41:14.780 --> 00:41:18.780
When our system's back up, do you want to move forward with our operation?

00:41:18.780 --> 00:41:24.139
Who's been in here?

00:41:24.139 --> 00:41:25.139
No one. We're secured.

00:41:25.139 --> 00:41:35.110
We won't be renewing the operation.

00:41:35.110 --> 00:41:39.110
We've been blocked by a new player.

00:41:39.110 --> 00:41:44.250
It's time for a new game.

